sequenceDiagram
 actor Citizen
 participant UI as Browser
 participant API as Express + RBAC
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 participant W as Outbox worker
 participant C as Registry
 actor Auditor
 Citizen->>UI: Submit fictional report
 UI->>API: POST incident + bearer + idempotency key
 API->>DB: Begin transaction
 API->>DB: Incident + timeline + audit + pending outbox
 API->>DB: Commit
 API-->>UI: Reference and status
 W->>DB: Claim eligible jobs under signer lock
 W->>C: Check UUID; anchor digest if absent
 C-->>W: Transaction receipt
 W->>DB: Confirm anchor, commit queue updates
 Auditor->>API: Verify full inventory
 API->>C: Enumerate UUIDs and read commitments
 API->>DB: Reconstruct canonical evidence
 API->>DB: Persist run, findings and notifications
 API-->>Auditor: Verification results and next steps
